    "title": "3 Key Areas You MUST Check If You Have TOS Symptoms!",
    "promiseDescription": "A follow-up video detailing the anatomy of the scalene, subclavius and pectoralis minor muscles involved in thoracic outlet syndrome and giving specific stretches and provocation tests for each.",
