    "title": "How to Know More About Pain | Definition of Pain and How to Treat Pain",
    "promiseDescription": "Janne gives an accessible explanation of the official definition of pain, the different nerve fiber groups involved in transmitting pain signals, and walks through the main pain mechanisms - mechanical, inflammatory, ischemic, peripheral neurogenic, neuropathic, nociplastic, and the psychosocial/chronic and iatrogenic aspects of pain - with everyday examples.",
